cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article and this archive."
type: software
title: "An aromatic anchor, not the Q motif, marks the DEAD-box ATP site: code and data"
abstract: >-
  Code, curated inputs and intermediate tables for a computational study of the
  aromatic anchor upstream of the Q motif in DEAD-box RNA helicases: all
  nucleotide-bound SF2 helicase structures, a census of 156,510 DEAD-box sequences
  (UniProt 2026_03), AlphaFold models, ancestral state reconstruction and human
  genetic variation.
